  "remarks": "Svetlana Bespalova has been the Deputy Minister of Education, Science and Youth of the so-called “Republic of Crimea” since April 2022. Within the ministry, she is responsible for legal framework and state policy in the field of general education, education in the native language, and according to the Ministry’s action plan, the implementation of the cadet component of general education. Therefore, Svetlana Bespalova bears responsibility for the current state of education in the so-called “Republic of Crimea” and plays an important role in the indoctrination and in the russification of Ukrainian minors and in the militarisation of education in Crimea. Moreover, the Ministry of Education implements the Decree of the President of the Russian Federation, which aims to promote Russian patriotic education. For example, amongst the activities planned to achieve goals for 2030, Svetlana Bespalova is responsible for organising military-patriotic events related to cadet classes, such as “Raising Patriots” and “Suvorov Readings”.",
